@startuml
title Login

actor Client
participant "Express Router" as Router
participant "AuthController\n(ctrl.login)" as Ctrl
participant "AuthService\n(svc.login)" as Svc
database "MongoDB" as DB

Client -> Router: POST /login {email|username, password}
Router -> Ctrl: ctrl.login(req, res)
Ctrl -> Ctrl: Lấy ip, user_agent\nusernameOrEmail = email || username
Ctrl -> Svc: login({ usernameOrEmail, password, ip, user_agent })

' 1) Tìm account
Svc -> DB: Account.findOne({ email|username }).select("+password")
DB --> Svc: acc (ACTIVE)

' 2) Xác thực mật khẩu (ok)
Svc -> Svc: Verify password (ok)

' 3) Ghi nhận login thành công
Svc -> DB: LoginAttempt.create({ ip, email: acc.email,\n account_id: acc._id, ok:true,\n reason: acc.email_verified ? "ok" : "email_not_verified_but_login_allowed" })
DB --> Svc: saved

' 4) Lấy thông tin user
Svc -> DB: User.findOne({ account_id: acc._id }).select(...).lean()
DB --> Svc: user

' 5) Nếu là bệnh nhân, lấy patient
opt Nếu role == PATIENT
  Svc -> DB: Patient.findOne({ user_id: user._id }).lean()
  DB --> Svc: patient
end

' 6) Trả kết quả
Svc --> Ctrl: { ok:true, account, user, patient?,\n mustVerify: !acc.email_verified }
Ctrl --> Client: 200 JSON { ok:true, ... }

@enduml
